---
import { PLAY_STORE_URL } from '../data/navigation';
---

<section class="contribution-section">
  <div class="container contrib-inner">
    <div class="contrib-graphic">
      <div class="card-back"></div>
      <div class="card-front">
        <span class="eyebrow" style="color:#f3e5ab; font-size:0.75rem; letter-spacing:1.5px;">COMPANY CONTRIBUTION</span>
        <h3>Exclusive Completion Bonus</h3>
        <p>Successfully complete your scheme and we reward you with exclusive benefits as per the applicable scheme terms.</p>
        <div class="gift-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <polyline points="20 12 20 22 4 22 4 12"></polyline>
            <rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="5"></rect>
            <line x1="12" y1="22" x2="12" y2="7"></line>
            <path d="M12 7H7.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5C11 2 12 7 12 7z"></path>
            <path d="M12 7h4.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 0-5C13 2 12 7 12 7z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="contrib-content">
      <div class="section-header left-align" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        <span class="eyebrow" style="color: var(--color-gold-dark);">— BONUS BENEFIT</span>
        <h2 style="color: var(--color-burgundy); font-size: 2.8rem; margin-top: 0.5rem;">Company Contribution</h2>
        <!-- Gold line under heading -->
        <div style="width: 60px; height: 2px; background: var(--color-gold); margin-top: 1rem;"></div>
      </div>
      <p>At Suvarna Bhagya, we believe in rewarding our loyal customers. Upon successful completion of your Scheme, we offer exclusive benefits as per the applicable scheme terms and conditions.</p>
      <p>This contribution makes your jewellery purchase even more rewarding — because we believe that when our customers grow, we grow with them.</p>
      
      <div class="highlight-box">
        The exact contribution amount and terms are detailed in the scheme-specific Terms & Conditions available on the App and website.
      </div>
      
      <a href={PLAY_STORE_URL} target="_blank" class="btn-primary" style="display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; background: var(--color-burgundy); color: #fff; padding: 0.8rem 1.8rem; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600;">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M3,20.5V3.5C3,2.91 3.34,2.39 3.84,2.15L13.69,12L3.84,21.85C3.34,21.6 3,21.09 3,20.5M16.81,15.12L6.05,21.34L14.54,12.85L16.81,15.12M20.16,10.81C20.5,11.08 20.75,11.5 20.75,12C20.75,12.5 20.53,12.9 20.18,13.18L17.89,14.5L15.39,12L17.89,9.5L20.16,10.81M6.05,2.66L16.81,8.88L14.54,11.15L6.05,2.66Z" /></svg>
        JOIN & START SAVING
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .contribution-section { padding: 8rem 0; background: #fff; }
  .contrib-inner { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 5rem; align-items: center; }
  
  .contrib-graphic { position: relative; height: 350px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
  .card-back {
    position: absolute; width: 320px; height: 200px;
    background: #f7eedc; border-radius: 12px;
    transform: rotate(-5deg) translateY(20px);
  }
  .card-front {
    position: relative; width: 320px; height: 200px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6b0f2a 0%, #8a1335 100%);
    border-radius: 12px; padding: 2rem; color: #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(107,15,42,0.3);
    z-index: 2;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column;
  }
  .card-front h3 { color: #fff; font-size: 1.4rem; margin: 0.5rem 0 0.8rem; }
  .card-front p { font-size: 0.85rem; color: #ddd; line-height: 1.4; margin: 0; }
  
  /* Replaced Emoji with SVG Icon */
  .gift-icon {
    margin-top: auto; /* Pushes icon to the bottom */
    color: var(--color-gold);
    width: 28px; height: 28px;
  }
  .gift-icon svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; }

  .section-header.left-align h2 { font-size: 2.8rem; }
  .contrib-content p { color: var(--color-text-light); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-size: 1.05rem; }
  
  .highlight-box {
    background: #fdf8eb; border-left: 3px solid var(--color-gold);
    padding: 1.5rem; font-style: italic; color: #7a5d18;
    margin-bottom: 2rem; font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .contrib-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 4rem; }
    .contrib-graphic { height: auto; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  }
</style>